Your search has not been successful, or you have a specific need?
Describe your location project to us. Foncier+ will relay your request to the territories and the local contacts able to respond.

To help us point you in the right direction, please specify:
- Your business sector and key constraints (water, power supply, logistics access, environmental permits…).
- Your search criteria: surface area (land/buildings), geographic area and timeline.

You can also attach your specifications.

